sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Medewerker
  participant C as Client-app<br/>(bv. handscanner)
  participant S as HTTP-server<br/>main.py :3000
  participant A as auth_provider
  participant U as user.json
  participant H as handle_*_version_1
  participant D as data_provider + model
  participant J as data/*.json
  M->>C: actie (bv. scan order)
  C->>S: TCP-verbinding naar poort 3000 (HTTP, geen TLS)
  C->>S: GET /api/v1/orders/1<br/>Header API_KEY: <sleutel>
  S->>A: get_user(api_key)
  A->>U: open + json.load (elke request)
  U-->>A: lijst met 6 apps
  alt key ontbreekt of onbekend
    A-->>S: None
    S-->>C: 401 Unauthorized (lege body)
  else key geldig
    A-->>S: user
    S->>S: pad splitsen, controleer /api/v1
    alt pad zonder /api/v1
      S--xC: geen response, verbinding gesloten
    else
      S->>H: paths, user
      H->>A: has_access(user, paths, "get")
      alt geen recht op resource/methode
        H-->>C: 403 Forbidden (lege body)
      else recht
        H->>D: fetch_order_pool().get_order(1)
        D->>J: open + json.load (nieuw object per aanroep)
        J-->>D: data
        D-->>H: order of None
        H-->>C: 200 OK + JSON (ook bij None: body null)
      end
    end
    opt exceptie (bv. id = "abc")
      S-->>C: 500 Internal Server Error
    end
  end
  C-->>M: resultaat tonen
